{"schemaVersion":2,"dialogueId":"Dlg_03CA2A2F","title":"Get help from Gideon","entry":"Dlg_03CA2A2F::entry","exit":"Dlg_03CA2A2F::exit","nodes":[{"id":"DFr_7E8DDAD2","articyId":"72057645577636534","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Gideon","text":"Do we have business? I don't think I need anything from you now.","speakerId":"Ntt_970ECEDA","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Do we have business? I don't think I need anything from you now.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":475.0,"y":350.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"40587","byteOffset":29683432,"byteLength":372}},{"id":"DFr_9250B6C9","articyId":"72057645577636935","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Gideon","text":"The low rent extortionists targeting your new business... experiment. That Bodega is a disaster. You should have turned it down.","speakerId":"Ntt_970ECEDA","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"The low rent extortionists targeting your new business... experiment. That Bodega is a disaster. You should have turned it down.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":5,"name":"Smile"},"position":{"x":1075.0,"y":350.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"18660","byteOffset":14945432,"byteLength":472}},{"id":"DFr_DAD16E24","articyId":"72057645577636956","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Gideon","text":"You should own your bad business decisions. The Bodega is a problem, but these thugs are not. I can see them off... For a price.","speakerId":"Ntt_970ECEDA","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"You should own your bad business decisions. The Bodega is a problem, but these thugs are not. I can see them off... For a price.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":1675.0,"y":350.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"27497","byteOffset":18283872,"byteLength":436}},{"id":"DFr_0EF1E96A","articyId":"72057645577636971","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Gideon","text":"My price isn't Lims, it's access. I am working for Elodie, a local... person of influence. These thugs are on her payroll, and I am guessing she does not know about this little scheme of their's.","speakerId":"Ntt_970ECEDA","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"My price isn't Lims, it's access. I am working for Elodie, a local... person of influence. These thugs are on her payroll, and I am guessing she does not know about this little scheme of their's.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":2275.0,"y":350.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"37753","byteOffset":28619368,"byteLength":540}},{"id":"DFr_254BEA5F","articyId":"72057645577636985","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Gideon","text":"I need to know when they are coming in for... for one of your delicious Bodega sandwiches. Just a call. That's all I need.","speakerId":"Ntt_970ECEDA","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I need to know when they are coming in for... for one of your delicious Bodega sandwiches. Just a call. That's all I need.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":2875.0,"y":375.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"33848","byteOffset":20687928,"byteLength":432}},{"id":"DFr_0E7E6CFF","articyId":"72057645577636999","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Gideon","text":"That's my concern.","speakerId":"Ntt_970ECEDA","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"That's my concern.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":3475.0,"y":350.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"38576","byteOffset":28927968,"byteLength":328}},{"id":"DFr_63B1F018","articyId":"72057645577637013","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Gideon","text":"That's all I want. A call when our friends visit. And for that low price, your problem just... goes away.","speakerId":"Ntt_970ECEDA","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"That's all I want. A call when our friends visit. And for that low price, your problem just... goes away.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":5,"name":"Smile"},"position":{"x":4075.0,"y":350.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"28276","byteOffset":18580280,"byteLength":452}},{"id":"DFr_02272307","articyId":"72057645577637033","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Gideon","text":"You did the right thing coming to me. This whole situation is gone. Trust me. Your troubles, these people... Gone. Now please, excuse me. I'll see you around.","speakerId":"Ntt_970ECEDA","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"You did the right thing coming to me. This whole situation is gone. Trust me. Your troubles, these people... Gone. Now please, excuse me. I'll see you around.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":4675.0,"y":350.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"16911","byteOffset":14288016,"byteLength":468}},{"id":"DFr_814C1B19","articyId":"72057645577637049","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Ava","text":"I think we may have stumbled into something.","speakerId":"Ntt_DC270F89","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I think we may have stumbled into something.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":5275.0,"y":350.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"33523","byteOffset":20564928,"byteLength":388}},{"id":"DFr_03854008","articyId":"72057645577637063","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Ava","text":"Perhaps not. It seems Gideon was already after these criminals. Or could win favor with a local crime boss by turning them in.","speakerId":"Ntt_DC270F89","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Perhaps not. It seems Gideon was already after these criminals. Or could win favor with a local crime boss by turning them in.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":5875.0,"y":350.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"32383","byteOffset":20132952,"byteLength":436}},{"id":"DFr_789E99F9","articyId":"72057645577637077","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Ava","text":"To protect us? No. But to remove our common enemies? Yes. Yes, I believe we can.","speakerId":"Ntt_DC270F89","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"To protect us? No. But to remove our common enemies? Yes. Yes, I believe we can.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":6475.0,"y":350.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"22985","byteOffset":16580160,"byteLength":388}},{"id":"DFr_C0CEB4E3","articyId":"72057645577637090","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Ava","text":"I suggest we wait. And if those unsavory individuals try and collect from us again, we call Gideon. Though I fear he may already be on their trail.","speakerId":"Ntt_DC270F89","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I suggest we wait. And if those unsavory individuals try and collect from us again, we call Gideon. Though I fear he may already be on their trail.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":7075.0,"y":350.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"34432","byteOffset":20909144,"byteLength":456}},{"id":"DFr_2E0BB45D","articyId":"72057645577637105","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Ava","text":"Too early to say... But we can hope.","speakerId":"Ntt_DC270F89","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Too early to say... But we can hope.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":7675.0,"y":350.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"51161","byteOffset":33768352,"byteLength":344}},{"id":"DFr_6FD5F735","articyId":"72057645577636928","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"I need something from YOU.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I need something from YOU.","TextSheVersion":"I need something from YOU.","TextTheyVersion":"I need something from YOU."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":775.0,"y":350.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"43326","byteOffset":30719976,"byteLength":308}},{"id":"DFr_730203CD","articyId":"72057645577636942","type":"choice","className":"DialogueFragment","speaker":"Player","text":"I couldn't turn it down.","speakerId":"Ntt_4A96A8B1","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I couldn't turn it down.","TextSheVersion":"I couldn't turn it down.","TextTheyVersion":"I couldn't turn it down."},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":null,"position":{"x":1375.0,"y":225.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"35308"